    <chapter title="Test Scenarios">
        <procedure title="Adds an Email Template" id="test-1">
            <p><b>Scenario:</b> Add Email Template</p>
            <p>Creates a new email template linked to an intro/ending</p>
            <step>1. Navigate to Email Templates settings. 2. Click "Add" and fill in subject. 3. Select the intro/ending from dropdown. 4. Enter email body text. 5. Save the template.</step>
            <chapter title="Expected Results">
                <p>• Email template is saved and success message is displayed.</p>
            </chapter>
        </procedure>
